TI  - Enhanced Continual Learning of Vision-Language Models with Model Fusion
AU  - Haoyuan Gao
AU  - Zicong Zhang
AU  - Yuqi Wei
AU  - Linglan Zhao
AU  - Guilin Li
AU  - Yexin Li
