TI  - Tug-of-War No More: Harmonizing Accuracy and Robustness in Vision-Language Models via Stability-Aware Task Vector Merging
AU  - Junhao Dong
AU  - Xinghua Qu
AU  - Cong Zhang
AU  - Qi Rong Sua
AU  - Nguyen Duc Thai
AU  - Wenbo Pan
AU  - Xinfeng Li
AU  - Tongliang Liu
